        <mxCell id="legend" value="Blue: customer → ISV; green: ISV → customer (intended paths)&#xa;Routing Intent can override the NVA next hop; verify with captures.&#xa;Demo: one non-zonal NVA; dashed = optional additional NVA.&#xa;* NVA private IPs are dynamically allocated; shown addresses are examples.&#xa;Each NVA has an outbound public IP; workloads have none." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
